### Create Campaign
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qarzdorlik eslatmasi - May 2026",
  "type": "DEBT_COLLECTION",
  "dialWindowStart": "09:00:00",
  "dialWindowEnd": "19:00:00",
  "dialDays": ["MONDAY", "TUESDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "THURSDAY", "FRIDAY"],
  "maxAttempts": 3,
  "retryIntervalMinutes": 60,
  "maxConcurrentCalls": 10,
  "dailyCallCap": 500,
  "aiAgentId": 1
}

### Filter Campaigns
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Get Campaign
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Campaign
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qarzdorlik eslatmasi - May 2026 (Updated)",
  "dialWindowStart": "09:30:00",
  "dialWindowEnd": "18:30:00",
  "dialDays": ["MONDAY", "TUESDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "THURSDAY"],
  "maxAttempts": 4,
  "retryIntervalMinutes": 45,
  "maxConcurrentCalls": 15,
  "dailyCallCap": 600,
  "aiAgentId": 1
}

### Clone Campaign
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/clone
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Start Campaign
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/start
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Pause Campaign
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Archive Campaign
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Add Targets
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/targets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

[
  {
    "clientId": 101,
    "phone": "+998901234567",
    "language": "uz-UZ",
    "contextData": {
      "clientName": "Anvar Aliyev",
      "debtAmount": "500000",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-01"
    }
  }
]

### List Targets
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/targets/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### Mark Target Do Not Call
POST http://localhost:8080/api/targets/1/do-not-call
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### A/B TESTING VARIANTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Create Variant A (Direct & Formal)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/variants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Variant A - Rasmiy va Aniq",
  "aiAgentId": 1,
  "promptOverride": "Siz qat'iy va rasmiy ovozda to'lov sanasini kelishasiz.",
  "ttsVoiceId": "uz-dilshod-neural",
  "trafficWeight": 50
}

### 2. Create Variant B (Empathetic & Restructuring)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/variants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Variant B - Empatiya va Bo'lib to'lash",
  "aiAgentId": 1,
  "promptOverride": "Siz xushmuomala, mijoz holatini tushunadigan va bo'lib to'lashni taklif qiluvchi yordamchisiz.",
  "ttsVoiceId": "uz-nodira-neural",
  "trafficWeight": 50
}

### 3. List Campaign Variants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/variants
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Get A/B Test Real-Time Report & Winner
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/variants/report
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Configure the campaign's API target source
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/target-source
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "url": "https://crm.company.uz/api/overdue-clients",
  "method": "GET",
  "authHeaderName": "Authorization",
  "authHeaderValue": "Bearer test-token",
  "itemsPath": "data.items",
  "phoneField": "phone",
  "clientIdField": "client_id",
  "languageField": "lang",
  "replaceTargets": true,
  "syncOnRecurrence": true,
  "enabled": true
}

### Read it back (authHeaderValue is never returned)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/target-source
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Fetch the list now instead of waiting for the next recurrence run
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/targets/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Remove the source
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/target-source
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
